What ChatGPT/agents actually suck at

There are roughly six classes of external capabilities that remain valuable even as models become much smarter.

1. Knowing reality right now

LLMs are bad substitutes for sensors.

Examples:

domain.available
dns.propagated
url.live
mcp.live
api.price_now
package.latest_safe_version
email.mx_status
tls.certificate_status
oauth.endpoint_behavior
