What can ChatGPT not do?

Increasingly, very little in terms of reasoning.

But it will perpetually need other systems to observe, test, transact, verify, remember, execute and guarantee things in the outside world.

Those are the things I would build.

The best one-line doctrine for finalbuildideas may therefore be:

Never sell reasoning an agent already owns. Sell observations, integrations, execution, decisions and proofs that are cheaper to buy than reproduce.

That gives you a surprisingly ruthless filter for the 60 ideas.